<title>NORWAY: Norway expands 2007 bond by 3.0 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway expands 2007 bond by 3.0 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 3.0 billion crowns</p>
<p>COUPON: 6.75 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: January 15, 2007</p>
<p>AUCTION DATE: September 2, 1996</p>
<p>NOTES: This is an expansion of bond S467 issued on January 12. 1996.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
